                                                "sense_id": "e2b98bbf-10b8-3e53-9ff6-29832d6b604d",
                                                "text": "[…] the sons are adorned in the very height of the fashion, with white pantaloons, watch chains and Wellingtons, and a charley at their under lip […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4070d971-f912-4302-8685-3bf29498250e",
                                                "sense_id": "e2b98bbf-10b8-3e53-9ff6-29832d6b604d",
                                                "text": "That square, short man... wearing a moustache and Charlie is William Laud [F&H]."
